	(descr "Edge pads for a 4x4 tact keypad module (QYF-JP01 style, ~46 x 33 mm) with a RIGHT-ANGLE 1x8 header: R1 R2 R3 R4 C1 C2 C3 C4. The keypad hangs off the board edge (+Y), right side up, and its pins lie flat on these B.Cu pads. Keypad outline (F.Fab) estimated from a photo. Board edge 2.8 mm beyond the pad centres.")
